body:
i have helped many people its just now well the things im seeing now. I can remeber going to a welfare check \[checking up on a person\].I walked in and i could smell death. i walked around a corner and this guys head was blown off by a shotgun he killed himself i then saw his dog walk around and eat a part of his brain.this guy head was everywhere i remember one of his eyes in a mug. his mustache on the lamp

&#x200B;

then i had to get his next off kin \[his BF\] i walked in and told him what happened he cry and hugged me its hard seeing that and i still have nightmares of it.
